<br/>
<br/>In the pre-raid Best in Slot gear for Feral Druid DPS you're going to be wearing a decent amount PvP items as the item level difference between those items and the options is big enough for the extra Agility to be worth it even though you lose an entire secondary stat. You only want to wear the PvP set if you can get 2-set, if you can't you would prefer optional items in those slots. 2-piece Tier 11 is fairly strong this phase for Feral Druid DPS, so you should aim to get that as soon as possible.<br/>For Feral Druid DPS all your stats are extremely close to each other in value, except for Agility which is far ahead. Meaning that you always want to prioritize high item-level items with Agility on them.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Feral Druid DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-feral-druid-dps">Head for Feral Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59455/agile-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Agile Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Agile Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> is your pre-raid Best in Slot helm as a Feral Druid DPS this helm requires the user to have max skill <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>. While it is recommended to have <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> as a Feral Druid DPS if you don't you can look to use <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56344/helm-of-numberless-shadows">
<img alt="Helm of Numberless Shadows" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_192.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of Numberless Shadows</span></a> dropping from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5088/the-stonecore">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Stonecore</span></a> on Heroic difficulty.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86934/arcanum-of-ramkahen">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Ramkahen</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
