<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-feral-druid-dps">Shoulders for Feral Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60447/vicious-gladiators-dragonhide-spaulders">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Dragonhide Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_pvpdruid_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Dragonhide Spaulders</span></a> is our best pre-raid option as a Feral Druid DPS but only if you get the 2-set. Without the 2-set from the PvP set, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69574/tusked-shoulderpads">
<img alt="Tusked Shoulderpads" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_58.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tusked Shoulderpads</span></a> is your best option.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86907/greater-inscription-of-shattered-crystal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal</span></a>, requires Exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>
