<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-feral-druid-dps">Hands for Feral Druid DPS</h4>Your pre-raid Best in Slot gloves are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60443/vicious-gladiators-dragonhide-gloves">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Dragonhide Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_leather_pvpdruid_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Dragonhide Gloves</span></a>, but only if you get the 2-set by wearing them. If you do not get 2-set from it then for Horde, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62417/liars-handwraps">
<img alt="Liar's Handwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_leatherraidrogue_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Liar's Handwraps</span></a> from <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1172/dragonmaw-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonmaw Clan</span></a> will be better, and for Alliance, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62433/stormbolt-gloves">
<img alt="Stormbolt Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_leatherraidrogue_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormbolt Gloves</span></a> from <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1174/wildhammer-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Wildhammer Clan</span></a> will be better. These are the same items the only difference is their name.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74255/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery</span></a> is taken over <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=44529/enchant-gloves-major-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Major Agility</span></a> as it provides significantly more total stats. However, the difference in damage output is very minimal due to how strong Agility is.<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Tinker for Engineers</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a>
