<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-feral-druid-dps">Legs for Feral Druid DPS</h4>Your pre-raid Best in Slot legs as a Feral Druid DPS is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60288/stormriders-legguards">
