<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-feral-druid-dps">Trinkets for Feral Druid DPS</h4>Feral Druid DPS loves Agility so any trinkets that provide agility are going to be your strongest. The best that are available pre-raid are going to be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58181/fluid-death">
<img alt="Fluid Death" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_vehicle_liquidpyrite_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fluid Death</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56328/key-to-the-endless-chamber">
<img alt="Key to the Endless Chamber" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Key to the Endless Chamber</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62468/unsolvable-riddle">
<img alt="Unsolvable Riddle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unsolvable Riddle</span></a> is a good alternative to <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56328/key-to-the-endless-chamber">
<img alt="Key to the Endless Chamber" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Key to the Endless Chamber</span></a>, and if used correctly can pull ahead on some bosses with damage amplification phases. Although technically not pre-raid, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59520/unheeded-warning">
<img alt="Unheeded Warning" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cat_trinket11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unheeded Warning</span></a> is a Binds on Equip item from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5334/the-bastion-of-twilight">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Bastion of Twilight</span></a>, that you can buy on the Auction House. This trinket is better than <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56328/key-to-the-endless-chamber">
<img alt="Key to the Endless Chamber" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Key to the Endless Chamber</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
