<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Feral Druid DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-handed-weapons-for-feral-druid-dps">Two handed Weapons for Feral Druid DPS</h4>With Phase 2 the Binds on Equip <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69843/mobuss-dripping-halberd">
<img alt="Mobus's Dripping Halberd" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_polearm_2h_cataclysm_b_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mobus's Dripping Halberd</span></a> is now available from the world boss <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=50009/mobus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mobus</span></a>, which is the best weapon option available. As this will be a hard-to-obtain item, the more conventional item to go for is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69626/jindos-verdict">
<img alt="Jin'do's Verdict" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_33.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jin'do's Verdict</span></a> from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=1977/zulgurub">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Gurub</span></a> which is the third-best weapon option. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=61340/vicious-gladiators-pike">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Pike" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_polearm_2h_pvp400_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Pike</span></a> is our second best option, to buy it you need to acquire 7200 total <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> before you can buy it even though it only costs 3400 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a>. There are a lot of good items for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> though, so you will not farm more than you can spend.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=95471/enchant-2h-weapon-mighty-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant 2H Weapon - Mighty Agility</span></a>
