<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relics-for-feral-druid-dps">Relics for Feral Druid DPS</h4>For your relic slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64671/relic-of-golganneth">
<img alt="Relic of Golganneth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Golganneth</span></a> will be your pre-raid Best in Slot option. This is the only item on this list that is also Phase 1 Best in Slot. Relic is the slot that gives you the least damage gain, so it could be wise to spend your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> elsewhere at the start if you can get either <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56316/sandshift-relic">
<img alt="Sandshift Relic" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qiraj_skinsandworm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandshift Relic</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62245/silver-inlaid-leaf">
<img alt="Silver Inlaid Leaf" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_idolofrejuvenation.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Silver Inlaid Leaf</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
